@entry place.hub.kim-office
  @scene place.kim-office
  @place-key home_kim
  @hub place
@endentry

:: place.kim-office [place hub]
@kind place

Kim is sitting at {{npc.kim.dependent}} desk. {{npc.kim.subject | cap}} looks up as you enter.

@choicegroup quest ""
  @choice rest-quest "Ask about the rent" -> story.rent.intro.2
    @when flags.rent_intro_2
    @endchoice
  @endchoicegroup

@choicegroup navigation ""
@choice leave "Leave" -> @leave-place
  @time 1m
@endchoice
@endchoicegroup

@sequence story.rent.intro.2 -> @exit

  You look around the office. There are stacks of papers and files on the desk, and a computer monitor is turned on, light flickering. \
  Kim is sitting in a chair behind the desk, 
  @if npc.kim.gender == "female"
    wearing a smart business suit and glasses.
  @else
    wearing an ironed white shirt and glasses.  
  @endif
  {{npc.kim.subject | cap}} eyes are brown, and they follow you as you open your mouth to speak.

  @choice has-money "Pay (800£)" -> .pay
    @when money >= 800
    @endchoice

  @choice no-money "Explain the situation" -> .no-money
    @when money < 800
    @endchoice

  @passage pay

        You hand over the 800£ to {{npc.kim.subject}}. {{npc.kim.subject | cap}} takes it and puts it in a drawer.
        @change money -800

        "Perfect!" {{npc.kim.subject}} says. "You are all caught up on your rent. Please make sure to pay on time in the future."  @change stat stress 5

        There's a note of self satisfaction in {{npc.kim.subject}} voice as {{npc.kim.subject}} says this.

  @next

  Now, was there something else? {{npc.kim.subject | cap}} looks at you expectantly. {{npc.kim.dependent | cap}} teeth are very white as {{npc.kim.subject}} smiles widely.

  @choice leave "Leave" -> .leave
  @endchoice



  @choice flirt "Flatter {{npc.kim.object}}" -> .flirt
    @change relationship kim 5
  @endchoice


    @passage flirt

    "Oh what big teeth you have!" you joke, smiling at {{npc.kim.subject}}. Immediately, Kim's smile falters, and {{npc.kim.subject}} looks at you with a mixture of confusion and concern.
    "What are you talking about?" {{npc.kim.subject}} asks, frowning. "That's not very flattering." @change relationship kim -10

    {{npc.kim.subject | cap}} keeps looking straight at you, unsmiling this time. You avert your eyes.
    

    @next "Just leave" -> .leave

    @passage no-money

    "I don't have the money to pay you right now," you say, trying to keep your voice calm. "Is there any way I can work something out with you?"

    {{npc.kim.subject | cap}} looks at you for a moment, then smiles. "I understand that things can be difficult sometimes. However, you still owe me the rent. I can give you a few days to come up with the money, but if you don't pay me by then, I will have to take further action." @change stat stress 10

    @next -> .leave

    @passage leave

    You leave the office, the new notice in your hand. You need to find a way to get the money to pay your rent, or you will be evicted.
    @effect flag rent_intro_2 false

    @next -> @exit

@endsequence
